  "details": "bool `VRCPlayerApi.Chatbox.IsTyping`\n\nstring `VRCPlayerApi.Chatbox.Text`\n\nThis opens up possibilities for chatting (with text) as a way to interact with the world, e.g. NPCs responding to certain keywords you are \"speaking\".\n\nOr world specific custom placement of Chatboxes. Maybe someone wants to do a presentation and needs their Chatbox enlarged for a large audience. This will be equivalent to player audio setting a higher voice gain.\n\nThis allows chatting to be an actual game mechanic in VRChat.",
